  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tPayroll\n\t\tPayroll FAQs\n\n### Adding New Car Details in P11D\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Fri, 10 May, 2024 at  3:39 PM\n\nAdding Car Details in P11D: A Step-by-Step Guide \n\nPayroll> P11D>P11D Forms \n\nNavigate> Payroll section and select P11D Forms. \n\nPlease refer to the below screenshot \n\nIn the P11D Forms menu, locate the Action dropdown. \n\nFrom the dropdown menu, select Edit. \n\nPlease refer to the below screenshot \n\nYou will then be directed to a screen where you can enter the necessary car details.  \n\nPlease refer to the below screenshot \n\nUnder the view car details  \n\nNavigate > Add New Car \n\nNow you can efficiently add the car details in the P11 D \n\nPlease refer to the below screenshot  \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
